"Kruskal-Wallis for three or more - so the p-value compares the distributions "
"rather than the means. The two do not have to agree. Choose the arsenal or "
"finalfit style if you need the test to match the statistic on display: both "
"run ANOVA (for two groups, the pooled-variance t-test, which assumes equal "
"variances) when means are shown and Kruskal-Wallis when medians are shown."
