#: package/analyses/grouplasso.description
#: grouplasso/options.description.main
msgid ""
"Group LASSO for Cox proportional hazards models enabling simultaneous "
"selection of pre-defined variable groups while maintaining within-group "
"structure. This method applies the group LASSO penalty (L1/L2 mixed norm) at "
"the group level using the grpreg package, ensuring entire groups of "
"variables are selected or excluded together. Ideal for categorical variables "
"with multiple dummy codes, grouped biomarkers, or structured predictors like "
"gene pathways. Supports adaptive group weights and comprehensive "
"cross-validation for optimal penalty selection. Particularly valuable for "
"genomic survival analysis, clinical prediction models with natural variable "
"groupings, and scenarios requiring interpretable group-wise feature "
"selection with preserved biological or clinical structure."
msgstr ""

