"two-dimensional histological sections. Calculates area density (Aa), volume "
"density (Vv), numerical density (Na), boundary density (Ba), and surface "
"density (Sv) using systematic grid-based sampling.\n"
"Essential for quantitative pathology: vessel density quantification, "
"fibrosis assessment, nuclear morphometry, and inflammation quantification. "
"Based on sampling theory from Kayser et al. (2009) and stereological methods "
"from Gundersen et al. (1985, 1986)."
